summary:
- topic: Meeting Opening and Roll Call
  text: The SouthPortlandBoardof Education held a special meeting, beginning with
    a roll call and the Pledge of Allegiance.
- topic: Staff Resignations
  text: Superintendent Angela Atkinson Duina announced three resignations, including
    BrianCavanaugh (Assistant Director of Instructional Support), AmyBrier (Kindergarten
    teacher at Small), and AngelaCorcoran (Grade 1 teacher at Kaler).
- topic: Personnel Elections and Introductions
  text: The Board introduced and approved several personnel elections, notably SarahGlenn
