    Equity, and Inclusion.
- topic: Board Support for New Appointees
  text: Board members expressed strong support and enthusiasm for the new appointees,
    highlighting their positive reputations and commitment to the district's values.
- topic: Public Comment Period
  text: A public comment period for agenda items was held, but no citizens came forward
    to speak.
- topic: Executive Session for Collective Bargaining
  text: The Board voted to enter into ExecutiveSession to discuss collective bargaining
    with the SouthPortlandSchool Department ServiceEmployeesAssociation.
- topic: Meeting Adjournment
  text: Following the ExecutiveSession, the Board reconvened briefly to vote for adjournment.
